              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_203101601_910518957_content",
                "value": "被你看到了，嗯……刚才，\n我应该是，不知不觉，\n“在回忆中创作”起来了。",
